	(text "If spk / mic / ptt / gnd (tip to sleeve):\n- Soder JP3\n- Put a wire/jumber in place of C11\n- Do not solder C12 nor Q3\n\nIf spk / clone / mic+ptt / gnd (tip to sleeve):\n- Do NOT solder JP3\n- Solder C11, C12 and Q3\n\nJP1 and JP2 are here if we need to mix L/R signals"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 172.212 0)
